  "signatureHoleDescription": "Hole 3 is the longest at Kilborne at 495 feet — a par 4 that rewards a big, placed drive and a confident approach through the wooded parkland. It's the hole where the course's balance of fairness and technical challenge is on full display: clean golf gets a birdie look, sloppy golf pays in trees.",
  "localTips": "Free, flat, and well maintained with benches at every hole — one of Charlotte's most walkable courses. Multiple tees and pins keep it interesting. The par 3s are the heart of the round; the par 4s are where you make up strokes.",
